{"suttaId":"tha-ap38","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[3378,3393],"vripara":"84"},"segments":{"tha-ap38:0.3":"Adhimuttattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap38:1.1":"“Nibbute lokanāthamhi, atthadassīnaruttame;","tha-ap38:1.3":"Upaṭṭhahiṃ bhikkhusaṅghaṃ, vippasannena cetasā.","tha-ap38:2.1":"“Nimantetvā bhikkhusaṅghaṃ [saṃgharatanaṃ (sī. syā.)], ujubhūtaṃ samāhitaṃ;","tha-ap38:2.3":"Ucchunā maṇḍapaṃ katvā, bhojesiṃ saṅghamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap38:3.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap38:3.3":"Sabbe satte abhibhomi [atibhomi (sī. ka.)], puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap38:4.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap38:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ucchudānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap38:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap38:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā adhimutto thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap38:7.1":"Adhimuttattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2464,"to":2464,"paras":[{"para":2464,"vripara":"84","refs":["tha-ap38:1"],"lines":["Evaṃ katasambhāravasena arahattaṃ patvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>nibbute lokanāthamhī</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap38:1"],["tha-ap38:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap38:1.1","nibbute lokanāthamhī",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
